<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="hero container prose">
    <h1>About this lab</h1>
    <p class="lead">A practice-first Terraform learning path with browser simulator, local labs, and production-ready examples.</p>
    <h2>What's included</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>12 lessons</strong> — fundamentals through production patterns</li>
      <li><strong>Terraform simulator</strong> — init, plan, apply, state, workspaces</li>
      <li><strong>7 local labs</strong> — real Terraform on your machine</li>
      <li><strong>3 troubleshoot scenarios</strong> — validation, drift, state lock</li>
      <li><strong>Production examples</strong> — S3 + CloudFront with safeguards</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Repo</h2>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/Jacob-Idolor/Pet_Projects/tree/main/terraform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">terraform/</a> on GitHub</p>
